r, plus the AI features that use up your limit.","1f35e43b9b01eebaf477295061a5ebeb0a5a32c7":"You’ve reached your Canva plan’s monthly AI limit. You’ll be able to generate again soon.","1f547fb99173dde3d5b1afe12853b20f537d6b90":"Upgrade for more","34b1b03f9bb0ef093be64edff26034f4b0b5e52c":"You can generate again in {0, plural, one {# minute} other {# minutes}}","73afe01565a44afaafc63a35ce2dd310ede16917":"To skip the wait, upgrade your Canva plan.","895614f2cf994b4946ca2184e7b046616cdc87c1":"You’ll be able to generate again soon","a26381a02e90572e5ecee4afc4a0e61dc624ed2e":"Upgrade Canva plan","a2dd6b941c70c2604f8dc9a9b4353d145a05973e":"You’re getting close to your Canva plan’s monthly AI limit","cdbc238349c8c293b1798c2c82a00c9cd5ee3e62":"To keep creating here, you can upgrade your Canva plan any time. Or, keep chatting as normal.","d42af28f6e5d4c5d77cc1569df5c441254b88e0e":"You can generate again in {0, plural, one {# hour} other {# hours}}","e3a4db9ef874c3da9944df106c9903e88ce6e71c":"View Canva plan","ff61e24bda9d6e39a78ae617aefaf3d5cff8b4ba":"You’ve reached your Canva plan’s monthly AI limit. It resets on {0}."});

